tly find new friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are probably not secret foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete fun mini-games!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/573a1f6a129ffc65d336e096621314d7.poster.avif?t=1772469733\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/573a1f6a129ffc65d336e096621314d7.webm?t=1772469733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would the answer dissapoint you?...</p>", "short_description": "The Trial: Incipit is a story-driven adventure mixed with action and puzzles. Meet quirky characters, fight intense and engaging battles and discover the terrific secrets of the kingdom and it's heroes!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/cd6cc7b5d7cab54304610b37b73598dc1c69ccf9/header.jpg?t=1772469733", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/a06d504695307f7ba0aa6f9db7e79e4d5b7d54ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772469733", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/a06d504695307f7ba0aa6f9db7e79e4d5b7d54ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772469733", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium E2180 @ 2.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 315 / ATI Radeon HD 54